OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786605488
OL,3,CPolice launch investigation into
OL,4,Cremains of unborn baby found under
OL,5,Cbridge
OL,7,FOfficers are appealing for information
OL,8,Fafter the remains of an unborn baby
OL,9,Fwere discovered under a bridge.
OL,11,FPolice were called to a wooded area
OL,12,Funder the Hodder Bridge on Whalley
OL,13,FRoad in Stonyhurst, Clitheroe on
OL,14,FTuesday 11 August, after a member of
OL,15,Fthe public found the remains inside of
OL,16,Fa bag.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
