FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786605488
OL,3,CPolice launch investigation into
OL,4,Cremains of unborn baby found under
OL,5,Cbridge
OL,7,FDetectives have now opened an
OL,8,Finvestigation into how the remains
OL,9,Fcame to be there, and are calling for
OL,10,Fanyone who has been in the area on the
OL,11,Fdays following up to the discovery to
OL,12,Fget in touch.
OL,14,FThey are particularly keen to speak to
OL,15,Fa man who was in the area with two
OL,16,Fchildren on Tuesday between 1pm and
OL,17,F3pm.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786605488
OL,3,CPolice launch investigation into
OL,4,Cremains of unborn baby found under
OL,5,Cbridge
OL,7,FLancashire Police say they do not
OL,8,Fbelieve the foetus to have been full
OL,9,Fterm, but they are yet to determine
OL,10,Fthe exact point of gestation, along
OL,11,Fwith the identity of the mother.
OL,13,FDCI Jill Vescovi of our Force Major
OL,14,FInvestigation Team said: "We have a
OL,15,Flive investigation underway following
OL,16,Fthe devastatingly sad discovery of
OL,17,Fthis little one. Our enquiries are in
OL,18,Ftheir very early stages, and we are
OL,19,Fworking to determine the important
OL,20,Ffacts.
OL,26,@vD@ZOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786605488
OL,3,CPolice launch investigation into
OL,4,Cremains of unborn baby found under
OL,5,Cbridge
OL,7,F"What we do know is that it is really
OL,8,Fimportant for us to find the mother of
OL,9,Fthis baby. We are concerned about her
OL,10,Fhealth, and her welfare, and urgently
OL,11,Fneed to identify her and speak to her.
OL,13,F"I know that she must have been
OL,14,Fthrough something horrific, and she
OL,15,Fmay be frightened about coming
OL,16,Fforward. We need to speak to her so
OL,17,Fthat we can find out what happened,
OL,18,Fand so that we are able to give her
OL,19,Fbaby the goodbye they deserve.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786605488
OL,3,CPolice launch investigation into
OL,4,Cremains of unborn baby found under
OL,5,Cbridge
OL,7,F"I want to make a direct appeal to her
OL,8,Ftoday to ask her to please come
OL,9,Fforward and speak to us, or someone
OL,10,Fshe trusts who will make a report. We
OL,11,Fwant to make sure you are safe and
OL,12,Fthat you have had any relevant
OL,13,Ftreatment you may need.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786605488
OL,3,CPolice launch investigation into
OL,4,Cremains of unborn baby found under
OL,5,Cbridge
OL,7,F"It's also really important that we
OL,8,Fspeak to people who were in the area
OL,9,Frecently, to help us try and determine
OL,10,Fhow the foetus came to be in this
OL,11,Farea. Someone will know what has
OL,12,Fhappened, and it is my, and my team's
OL,13,Fjob to find out exactly what. We have
OL,14,Fenquiries ongoing, but we need your
OL,15,Fhelp. If you know anything, no matter
OL,16,Fhow insignificant you may think it is,
OL,17,Fplease get in touch with us."
OL,26,@oD@AOUyD@]O]
